l law strictly prohibits the _______ of individuals, especially during times of conflict. <em>(jogellenesen elvisz \/ szem\u00e9lyt elhurcol)<\/em><\/p><p>In some species, the male will _______ the female&#039;s eggs to a safer location for incubation. <em>(elvisz \/ \u00e1thelyez)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel&#039;s plot revolves around a daring plan to _______ the wealthy industrialist&#039;s daughter for ransom. <em>(elrabol \/ emberrabl\u00e1st hajt v\u00e9gre)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elrabol \/ elhurcol \/ elt\u00e9r\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabadon enged \/ elenged \/ visszaad<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a child = gyermeket elrabolni (pl. They threatened to abduct the child if their demands were not met.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ for ransom = v\u00e1lts\u00e1gd\u00edj\u00e9rt elrabolni (pl. The criminals abducted the businessman for ransom.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a person = szem\u00e9lyt elrabolni (pl. It is a serious crime to abduct a person.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ someone from their home = valakit elrabolni az otthon\u00e1b\u00f3l (pl. The gang abducted him from his home in the middle of the night.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>abduct<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>abduction<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>abduct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: abduct a child \/ abduct for ransom \/ abduct a person \/ abduct someone<\/span><\/p><p>similar: kidnap \/ seize \/ carry off \/ snatch<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: release \/ free \/ return<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"abduct\nabduction","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#64e1f2","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T16:38:12+00:00"},{"id":51318,"front":"<p>The old, abandoned house was known for its _______ occurrences, with strange lights and whispers reported by many. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ szellemszer\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>Scientists used _______ analysis to identify the chemical composition of the distant star, examining the different wavelengths of light it emitted. <em>(spektr\u00e1lis \/ sz\u00ednk\u00e9pelemz\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>After the tragic event, a _______ silence fell over the crowd, a chilling quiet that spoke volumes. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ borzongat\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>Her performance had a _______ quality, as if she were a ghost dancing on stage, captivating the audience with her ethereal movements. <em>(szellemszer\u0171 \/ \u00e9terikus)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ szellemszer\u0171 \/ spektr\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): val\u00f3s\u00e1gos \/ k\u00e9zzelfoghat\u00f3 \/ anyagi<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ analysis = spektr\u00e1lis anal\u00edzis (pl. The lab conducted _______ analysis to identify the unknown substance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ presence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties jelenl\u00e9t (pl. Many reported a _______ presence in the old mansion.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ light = spektr\u00e1lis f\u00e9ny \/ k\u00eds\u00e9rteties f\u00e9ny (pl. The aurora borealis displayed a dazzling array of _______ light.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ silence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties csend (pl. A _______ silence fell over the empty stadium.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>spectrally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>spectrum<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: spectral analysis \/ sp