noble cause \/ noble gesture \/ noble family \/ noble spirit<\/span><\/p><p>similar: honorable \/ generous \/ dignified \/ aristocratic<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: dishonorable \/ ignoble \/ base<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"noble","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T10:15:45+00:00"},{"id":51287,"front":"<p>Please _______ of your waste responsibly by using the recycling bins provided. <em>(megszabadul \/ eldob \/ kidob)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to _______ of its non-essential assets to reduce debt. <em>(elad \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kes\u00edt \/ megszabadul)<\/em><\/p><p>He was able to _______ of the problem quickly and efficiently. <em>(megold \/ elint\u00e9z \/ rendez)<\/em><\/p><p>The general will _______ his troops for battle at dawn. <em>(elrendez \/ fel\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ csatarendbe \u00e1ll\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megszabadul \/ elrendez \/ elad<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megtart \/ meg\u0151riz \/ beszerez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of something = megszabadul valamit\u0151l (pl. We need to dispose of these old documents.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of waste = hullad\u00e9kot elhelyez\/kidob (pl. How do you dispose of hazardous waste?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of assets = vagyont\u00e1rgyakat elad\/megszabadul t\u0151l\u00fck (pl. The firm plans to dispose of its foreign assets.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of a problem = megold egy probl\u00e9m\u00e1t (pl. He quickly disposed of the minor issue.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disposable<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disposal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: dispose of \/ waste dispose \/ assets dispose \/ properly dispose<\/span><\/p><p>similar: discard \/ get rid of \/ sell \/ arrange<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ acquire<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T11:31:59+00:00"},{"id":51319,"front":"<p>The orchestra&#039;s new _______ brought a fresh energy to their classical performances. <em>(karmester \/ zenekarvezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>Copper is an excellent _______ of electricity, which is why it&#039;s used in wiring. <em>(vezet\u0151 (anyag) \/ \u00e1ramvezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>On the bus, the _______ collected tickets and helped passengers with their luggage. <em>(kalauz \/ ellen\u0151r)<\/em><\/p><p>The research team is looking for a material that acts as a super_______ at room temperature. <em>(szupravezet\u0151 \/ nagyon j\u00f3 vezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">karmester \/ kalauz \/ vezet\u0151 (anyag)<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szigetel\u0151 \/ akad\u00e1lyoz\u00f3 \/ g\u00e1tl\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 orchestra _______ = zenekari karmester (pl. The orchestra conductor raised his baton.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 electrical _______ = elektromos vezet\u0151 (pl. Copper is a good electrical conductor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 bus _______ = buszkalauz (pl. The bus conductor announced the next stop.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 heat _______ = h\u0151vezet\u0151 (pl. Metals are generally good heat conductors.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>conductor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>conductor<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>conduct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: orchestra conductor \/ electrical conductor \/ bus conductor \/ train conductor<\/span><\/p><p>similar: director \/ maestro \/ guide \/ usher<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: insulator \/ nonconductor \/ obstructor<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"conductor","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T11:31:24+00:00"},{"id":51274,"front":"<p>The politician&#039;s affair caused a huge public _______. <em>(botr\u00e1ny \/ szenz\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The company was involved in a financial _______ that led to its collapse. <em>(vissza\u00e9l\u00e9s \/ \u00fcgy \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigation uncovered a deep-seated _______ within the organization. <em>(\u00f6sszeesk\u00fcv\u00e9s \/ rossz \u00fcgy \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel&#039;s plot revolved around a dark family _______ that haunted generations. <em>(titok \/ sz\u00e9gyenfolt \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">botr\u00e1ny \/ szenz\u00e1ci\u00f3 \/ \u00fcgy \/ vissza\u00e9l\u00e9s \/ sz\u00e9gyenfolt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztess\u00e9g \/ becs\u00fclet \/ er\u00e9ny<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cause a _______ = botr\u00e1nyt okoz (pl. The news caused a huge scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai botr\u00e1ny (pl. The minister resigned after the political scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 financial _______ = p\u00e9nz\u00fcgyi botr\u00e1ny (pl. The company faced a major financial scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ erupts = kit\u00f6r a botr\u00e1ny (pl. A new scandal erupted in the government.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______-hit = botr\u00e1nyt\u00f3l s\u00fajtott (pl. The scandal-hit celebrity tried to avoid the press.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>scandal<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>scandal<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: political scandal \/ financial scandal \/ public scandal \/ sex scandal<\/span><\/p><p>similar: outrage \/ disgrace \/ shock \/ controversy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: honor \/ integrity \/ virtue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"scandal","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-19T12:11:47+00:00"},{"id":51276,"front":"<p>The police managed to _______ the drug shipment before it reached the city. <em>(megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ lefoglal)<\/em><\/p><p>In tennis, a player can _______ their opponent&#039;s serve if they are fast enough. <em>(vissza\u00fct \/ elkap)<\/em><\/p><p>The intelligence agency was able to _______ the communication between the two hostile nations. <em>(lehallgat \/ elfog)<\/em><\/p><p>The knight bravely rode to _______ the princess from the dragon&#039;s lair. <em>(megment \/ kiszabad\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfog \/ megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ lefoglal \/ megment \/ visszafog<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elenged \/ \u00e1tenged \/ seg\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a message = \u00fczenetet elfog\/lehallgat (pl. They managed to intercept a coded message.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a pass = passzt elfog\/elkap (pl. The defender intercepted the pass and scored.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a shipment = sz\u00e