udc49 steel-cut _______ = v\u00e1gott zabpehely (pl. Steel-cut _______ take longer to cook but have a chewier texture.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ porridge = zabk\u00e1sa (pl. A warm bowl of _______ porridge is perfect on a cold morning.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 wild _______ = vadzab (pl. Wild _______ can be found growing in many fields.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: oats and honey \/ oats for breakfast \/ oats in baking \/ oats for horses<\/span><\/p><p>similar: oatmeal \/ porridge \/ groats \/ cereals<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: wheat \/ rice \/ corn<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"oats","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-21T16:17:19+00:00"},{"id":51293,"front":"<p>The old Hollywood star lived in a sprawling _______ with a swimming pool and tennis courts. <em>(kast\u00e9ly \/ palota)<\/em><\/p><p>After years of hard work, they finally achieved their dream of owning a grand _______ in the countryside. <em>(villa \/ k\u00faria)<\/em><\/p><p>The historic _______, now a museum, offers a glimpse into the opulent lifestyle of the 19th-century aristocracy. <em>(rezidencia \/ f\u0151\u00fari h\u00e1z)<\/em><\/p><p>He inherited a vast fortune and a magnificent ancestral _______, which he struggled to maintain. <em>(nemesi k\u00faria \/ nagym\u00e9ret\u0171 h\u00e1z)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kast\u00e9ly \/ villa \/ palota<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): kunyh\u00f3 \/ visk\u00f3 \/ kis h\u00e1z<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a sprawling _______ = egy terjedelmes kast\u0