 #22c55e\">pecs\u00e9tel \/ lez\u00e1r \/ f\u00f3ka \/ \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00edt \/ elnyom<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): kinyit \/ felbont \/ megnyit<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the deal = lez\u00e1rni az \u00fczletet, v\u00e9gleges\u00edteni a meg\u00e1llapod\u00e1st (pl. We need to _______ the deal by the end of the week.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with wax = viaszpecs\u00e9ttel lez\u00e1rni (pl. She used a red wax _______ to _______ the letter.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a record = rekordot fel\u00e1ll\u00edtani (pl. The athlete _______ a new world record.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the gap = a k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9get \u00e1thidalni, cs\u00f6kkenteni (pl. The new policy aims to _______ the gap between rich and poor.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>seal<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>seal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>seal<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: seal the deal \/ seal of approval \/ seal the envelope \/ seal the tomb<\/span><\/p><p>similar: close \/ fasten \/ shut \/ affix<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: open \/ unseal \/ break<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-28T16:18:25+00:00"},{"id":51306,"front":"<p>Let me _______ you to a nice dinner tonight to celebrate your promotion. <em>(megh\u00edv \/ vend\u00e9g\u00fcl l\u00e1t)<\/em><\/p><p>The doctor decided to _______ her with a new experimental drug for her rare condition. <em>(kezel \/ gy\u00f3gy\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s important to _______ all employees fairly, regardless of their background. <em>(b\u00e1nik \/ viszony