c49 public _______ = k\u00f6zfelh\u00e1borod\u00e1s (pl. There was a great deal of public _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 moral _______ = erk\u00f6lcsi s\u00e9rt\u00e9s (pl. The incident was seen as a moral _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>outrage<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>outrage<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>outrage<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public outrage \/ cause outrage \/ moral outrage \/ express outrage<\/span><\/p><p>similar: indignation \/ fury \/ anger \/ shock<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calmness \/ approval \/ acceptance<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":6,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"7 nap","good":"12 nap","easy":"16 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T18:53:34+00:00"},{"id":51333,"front":"<p>The feeling of impending doom was _______ as the storm approached. <em>(elker\u00fclhetetlen \/ kiker\u00fclhetetlen)<\/em><\/p><p>For many, the need to earn a living is an _______ reality. <em>(megker\u00fclhetetlen \/ kiker\u00fclhetetlen)<\/em><\/p><p>The consequences of climate change are becoming increasingly _______. <em>(elker\u00fclhetetlen \/ megker\u00fclhetetlen)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt an _______ urge to confess his secret. <em>(ellen\u00e1llhatatlan \/ k\u00e9nyszer\u00edt\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elker\u00fclhetetlen \/ kiker\u00fclhetetlen \/ megker\u00fclhetetlen<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elker\u00fclhet\u0151 \/ kiker\u00fclhet\u0151 \/ megker\u00fclhet\u0151<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an _______ truth = elker\u00fclhetetlen igazs\u00e1g (pl. The fact that we all age is an inescapable truth.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an _______ conclusi